%
( DEMO PROGRAM - KONI + M20x2.5 DIS CEKME )
( Kutuk: 50mm capinda silindirik malzeme, aynadan cikinti 80mm )
( Z0 = alin tornalanmis uc yuzey, eksi Z aynaya dogru gider )
( X ekseni YARICAP modundadir - G8, LinuxCNC varsayilani )
( Hedef Parca: Ucta R10mm / Cap 20mm -> Z-40'da R25mm / Cap 50mm koni )
(              Z-40 ile Z-62 arasi M20x2.5 silindirik dis bolgesi )
( T1 = Kaba kalemi, T2 = Finis kalemi, T3 = 3mm Keski, T4 = Dis kalemi )

G21         ( metrik )
G8          ( X ekseni yaricap modu )
G18         ( XZ duzlemi )
G90         ( mutlak koordinat sistemi )

T1 M6       ( kaba kalemi cagir )
G43 H1
S800 M3     ( fener mili 800 dev/dak )
G54

( --- alin tornalama --- )
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G1 Z0.0 F150
G1 X-0.5 F80
G0 Z2.0

( --- 1. ASAMA: DIS CEKILECEK SILINDIRIK FATURAYI KABA BOSALTMA --- )
( Koni Z-40'da bitecek, Z-40 ile Z-62 arasi M20 icin R10.0'a inecek )
G0 X22.0 Z2.0
G1 Z-62.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G0 X19.0
G1 Z-62.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G0 X16.0
G1 Z-62.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G0 X13.0
G1 Z-62.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G0 X10.3
G1 Z-62.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0

( --- 2. ASAMA: KONI PROFILINI KABA BOSALTMA (Z0 -> Z-40) --- )
G0 X22.0 Z2.0
G1 Z-32.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G0 X19.0
G1 Z-24.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G0 X16.0
G1 Z-16.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0
G0 X13.0
G1 Z-8.0 F150
G0 X26.0 Z2.0

( Kaba koni on finis pasosu - 0.3mm pay )
G0 X10.3 Z2.0
G1 Z0.0 F150
G1 X25.3 Z-40.0 F120
G0 X26.0 Z5.0

( --- takim degisimi: finis kalemi --- )
M5
T2 M6
G43 H2
S1200 M3

( --- finis pasosu: koni + M20 dis ustu capi + dis dibi bosaltma --- )
G0 X10.0 Z2.0
G1 Z0.0 F100
G1 X25.0 Z-40.0 F80       ( tam koni yuzeyi )
G1 X10.0 Z-40.0 F80       ( koni tabanina dik inis )
G1 Z-58.0 F80             ( M20 dis ustu yaricapi: R10.0mm )
G1 X8.3 Z-58.0 F60        ( dis kalemi cikis kanali / relief groove )
G1 Z-64.0 F80             ( keski kalemi icin bosluk )
G0 X26.0
G0 Z5.0

( --- takim degisimi: 60 derece metrik dis kalemi --- )
M5
T4 M6
G43 H4
S400 M3                   ( dis cekme icin dusuk devir: 400 rpm )

( --- M20x2.5 DIS CEKME CEVRIMI - LinuxCNC G76 --- )
( Hatve P=2.5mm, baslangic Z-37.0'dan bitis Z-59.0'a )
( Dis ustu yaricapi X10.0, dis dibi derinligi K=1.534mm [yaricapta] )
G0 X12.0 Z-37.0           ( emniyetli baslangic konumu )
G76 P2.5 Z-59.0 I-2.0 J0.25 K1.534 R1.5 Q29.5 H2 E1.5 L2
G0 X26.0
G0 Z5.0

( --- takim degisimi: keski kalemi --- )
M5
T3 M6
G43 H3
S600 M3

( --- Z-62 noktasindan parcayi koparma --- )
G0 X26.0 Z-62.0
G1 X-0.5 F40
G0 X26.0

M5                        ( fener mili durdur )
G0 X30.0 Z5.0
M2                        ( program sonu )
%